    {"loHz": 5250000, "hiHz": 5351500, "text": "Below 5351.5 kHz, Irish 60 m use is only on spot frequencies, and the licence does not say whether a spot frequency is the carrier or the centre of the channel, nor how wide a channel is: OpenHamShack refuses them until that is confirmed", "src": "C1 T2 p.21; ie.md s.3.1, s.8"},
    {"loHz": 5366500, "hiHz": 5450000, "text": "Above 5366.5 kHz, Irish 60 m use is only on spot frequencies, and the licence does not say whether a spot frequency is the carrier or the centre of the channel, nor how wide a channel is: OpenHamShack refuses them until that is confirmed", "src": "C1 T2 p.21; ie.md s.3.1, s.8"},
